## 🏗️ Architecture

The generated project follows a modular architecture where each feature owns its own:

- Controller
- Service
- Repository
- Model
- Route
- Constants
- Pipeline
- Utilities

Typical request flow:

```text
Route
   │
   ▼
Controller
   │
   ▼
Service
   │
   ▼
Repository
   │
   ▼
Mongoose Model
   │
   ▼
MongoDB
```

Business logic lives inside **Services**, while **Repositories** are responsible only for database access.

